Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 18:59:58 +0530
Subject: Crop parallel photo captures to square in 1:1 mode

While 1:1 quick-view streams and UI viewfinders are cropped to square,
the parallel image save pipeline in ParallelSaveRequest written to storage
directly writes the uncropped 4:3 sensor snapshot JPEG from Qualcomm Chi
HAL hardware (4096x3072).

Detect 1:1 square capture in ParallelSaveRequest and perform a center
square crop on the JPEG buffer prior to watermark stamping and storage
writing, updating the MediaStore image dimensions to match (3072x3072)
while preserving all EXIF tags.
